# Redirect old tool path to new
/tool/*  /tools/:splat  301

# Note: Root-level .html pages (tools-directory, privacy-policy, etc.)
# do NOT need explicit rules. Cloudflare Pages native pretty URLs
# automatically handles:
#   /tools-directory       → serve tools-directory.html (200)
#   /tools-directory.html  → 301 → /tools-directory
#   /tools-directory/      → 301 → /tools-directory
# Adding manual _redirects rules conflicts and causes redirect loops.

